            "review_text": "MangoMoore\nKanagawa Prefecture, Japan136 contributions\n0\nBanh mi is an easy-to-eat size\nAug 2024 • Solo\nI was introduced to a local travel agency. I ate in, but according to the Guide who was with me, there were many foreign companies in the neighborhood, so expats were coming. If you look closely, there are certainly some people who look like Japanese, and there are some Westerners. I think it goes well with Japanese people. I ate Banh mi and it was just the right size. It also tastes good. People around me were eating roasted birds, which looked delicious too.\nThe next day I took a motorcycle taxi and revisited it, this time taking it out. In addition to meat dishes, many mooncakes were sold.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 17, 2024",
