            "review_text": "paragon29er\nKobe, Japan438 contributions\n0\nDelicious, cheap, highly recommended.\nDec 2023 • Couples\nIt's a famous restaurant that seems to have been around for a long time.\nThey seem to be famous for their banh mi, but since I ate a lot of banh mi, I also had com ga and pho bo. The com ga was very tasty with the meat falling apart, and the pho was rich and close to the taste of Hanoi. Personally, I think it's my second favorite after Fortune in Hanoi.\nIn terms of hygiene, it seems like a normal restaurant, and it's not particularly dirty or clean, so I think it's easy to go in. I don't recommend coming here dressed nicely. You shouldn't come to a restaurant like this dressed nicely, right? Lol\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten December 1, 2023",
