            "review_text": "Zfy Ed\nSingapore, Singapore10979 contributions\n0\nNice food!\nDec 2022\nThis is one of the popular shop that sells a wide variety of local pastries and cakes and of course Banh Mi. (This review is for the outlet at 363 Hai Ba Trung, opposite of Cho Tan Dinh)\n\nWe didn't try the Banh Mi (as we know of other places that sell better ones) but opted for the local pastries that included the meat buns and banana kueh (cakes) with coconut. \n\nThe prices were reasonable and the food we bought were nice, even though we didn't eat on the spot (but later back at the hotel). Staff were friendly though they could not speak English.\n\nIt wasn't crowded when we arrived but shortly after we left, we saw quite a number of locals coming by to buy their foodstuff.\n\nDo give it a try if you would like to have a taste of the authentic local pastries and cakes!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 30, 2023",
